WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:08.020
What if you could go back in time and change something? You can change anything you want. What would it be?

00:00:10.370 --> 00:00:15.250
Dust yourself up and move on to the next one. I don't want the next one and why do you even care bro, look at you?

00:00:15.459 --> 00:00:17.858
You're a tall good looking dude and could probably have any girl in this bar.

00:00:17.859 --> 00:00:22.300
You know, maybe I failed to properly explain to you the boss employee relationship.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:25.660
I tell you what to do and you do it.

00:00:26.180 --> 00:00:31.270
You help rich people get richer. It's like teaching fish how to swim. You are really smart.

