I can't send you back. Look these equations. They're still unsolved.

00:01:22.400 --> 00:01:27.710
So unless you could solve them. Ya you know what, lets just give up, right? We keep trying. That's what we do. That's what we've been doing! We don't give up!

00:01:27.710 --> 00:01:28.210
(Yelling... We just keep trying!! I'm telling you it's just not possible!)

00:01:34.420 --> 00:01:41.649
I actually envy you, You envy the guy that's in love with the girl he can't have? I envy the guy who knows what he wants and

00:01:42.680 --> 00:01:44.680
